      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "840ac2ead2ac36305df45738663bb151ed1244f7fc6208ede90dba55c1f1ab77",
      "text": "The main itinerary on Day 8 includes an overland transfer from Petén to Belize; the separate Flores–Belize City flight listed among the supplements should not be considered mandatory without confirmation.",
