      "sourceTextSha256": "95d88e83f029b3f6a1af1ba366f06713452eae40641620906b647fe7ae752d8f",
      "text": "Day 12 includes a flight from Ambergris Caye to Belize City. Its cost and baggage conditions are not specified in the tariff table and must be confirmed before booking.",
