        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "model": "ChatGPT",
        "runId": "ada-en-1d528bec4ff4",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "Word 2027 paragraph 124 mentions the Day 12 return flight to Belize City, but the tariff table lists only Guatemala City–Flores and Flores–Belize City flights. No Word passage provides the current RU note requiring confirmation of the Ambergris Caye flight cost and baggage terms.",
